post_install() {
    cat <<'MESSAGE'
Candidate 6 adds offline UPDATE.APP partition extraction.
USB Update uses userspace libusb for USB Update. No DKMS build is required.
If upgrading from candidates 1-4, close Kirin Tool and other serial apps, then:
  sudo modprobe -r kirin_usb_update
Reconnect the phone to refresh USB permissions. Launch: kirin-tool-unstable
Read-only connection probe: kirin-usb-update-probe --open-close
This new USB Update transport still requires hardware validation.
MESSAGE
}
post_upgrade() { post_install; }
